# Release defaults of the dev channel (CLIENT-INSTALLER-0 section 2.3). UTF-8 KEY=VALUE lines.
# No hosted dev Platform is configured yet, so native login stays off: an empty
# OTERYN_PLATFORM_URL disables it. Operators point a client at an environment with a per-user
# %LOCALAPPDATA%\Oteryn\client.env override. OTERYN_UPDATE_URL is unset: no updater.
# Never add OTERYN_CHARACTER_ID, OTERYN_DEV_ROOT or any secret here.
OTERYN_PLATFORM_URL=
